{"4237340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The City Life", "steam_appid": 4237340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Life</strong> is an open-world life simulation and vehicle-building sandbox set in a modern British town. Start with nothing, take jobs, earn money, buy garages and homes, build and modify vehicles, and work your way into the proper city lifestyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin living in a small trailer community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take paid jobs: parcel delivery, bin collection, post service, taxi runs, bus routes, hydrant maintenance and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn wages and daily allowances from the Job Centre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy vehicles, maintain them, and customise parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade from a small shed to full auto garage ownership</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗 Vehicles &amp; Building</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, buy, repair, and assemble vehicles part-by-part</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyres, engines, batteries, panels, interiors and tuning upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic car physics and handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tow, scrap, sell, and rebuild</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏙 Open-World Living</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore shops, petrol stations, garages, housing districts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase apartments, garages, work bays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay rent, maintain property, and keep them before eviction timers expire</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Multiplayer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated multiplayer server support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player has individual missions, wages, garages, and home waypoints</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌧 Simulation Systems</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC routines (work, sleep, relax, eat)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economy with shops, repairs, property rental and resale</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Life</strong> is an open-world life simulation and vehicle-building sandbox set in a modern British town. Start with nothing, take jobs, earn money, buy garages and homes, build and modify vehicles, and work your way into the proper city lifestyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin living in a small trailer community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take paid jobs: parcel delivery, bin collection, post service, taxi runs, bus routes, hydrant maintenance and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn wages and daily allowances from the Job Centre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy vehicles, maintain them, and customise parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade from a small shed to full auto garage ownership</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗 Vehicles &amp; Building</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, buy, repair, and assemble vehicles part-by-part</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyres, engines, batteries, panels, interiors and tuning upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic car physics and handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tow, scrap, sell, and rebuild</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏙 Open-World Living</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore shops, petrol stations, garages, housing districts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase apartments, garages, work bays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay rent, maintain property, and keep them before eviction timers expire</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 